            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JAS.5.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yak 5:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Aso do, kolemutu imoŋin ikanykaarei ka imerekekin ikanykaarei, koloto neejai ekabulesit Yob, koinakis ainakineta nuieweio; kilipakini yes ekabulesit Yob; naarai ŋol ŋes acamunit, kenyek aiswamakin yes kwape ejaar akusibanaanut; naarai mam ineritos akirot naibeeokino mamakaŋ, kwape enerar ekabulesit Yob.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kosodi Elipas Etemanit, ka Bilidad Esukit, ka Sopar Enaamatit koloto, kiswamata kwape kicorakinia EJAKAIT: kosodi EJAKAIT aeamun Yob.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
